sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Server

    Note over C,S: Mercury cipher envelope active after logOnBegin/logOnComplete handshake

    alt createBasePlayer arrives first (common case)
        S->>C: createBasePlayer 0x05 u32 entityId + u16 typeId + property stream (CLIENT_DATA OR BASE_DATA equals 0x0E)
        S->>C: createCellPlayer 0x06 32B spaceId vehicleId posXYZ rotX/Z/Y (Y/Z swap, applied immediately since playerEntityId is non-zero)
    else createCellPlayer arrives first (defensive ordering)
        S->>C: createCellPlayer 0x06 32B fixed payload (playerEntityId is zero — buffered into ServerConnection+0xfe0)
        S->>C: createBasePlayer 0x05 u32 entityId + u16 typeId + property stream (handler replays buffered createCellPlayer once entityId is set)
    end

    Note over C: property stream rides INSIDE createBasePlayer envelope per S2

    C->>S: enableEntities 0x08 8B undefined stack content per S6

    Note over S: client signals ready and server begins streaming AoI introductions

    loop For each entity entering AoI
        S->>C: createEntity 0x09 entityId + classId + alias
        S->>C: enterAoI decrements entity+0x10 enterCount per §1.9
        S->>C: cached property-delta stream per-witness per §1.10 / OQ-6
    end

    Note over C: enterCount reaches zero — EntityManager_EnterWorld then FlushDeferredNotifications
    Note over C,S: World entry complete — steady-state updateEntity 0x0A traffic follows per §1.8
